    "text": "By Steve Metsch ,\n6 hours ago The La Grange Village Board unanimously approved a resolution of appreciation for Trustee Glenn Thompson at its recent meeting. Thompson, a board member for three years, is leaving for a new job in Florida. Thompson was a driving force in the village’s flood mitigation efforts. He helped establish Dry... Read full article\n1",
